{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"jimmy-moneta","name":"Jimmy Moneta","birthDate":"2000-07-20","birthPlace":"Bakersfield, California, USA","bio":"Jimmy Moneta (born July 20, 2000) is a Polish-American actor. Since beginning his acting career in 2019, he has appeared in a variety of film and television productions and is known for his smaller roles in massive franchises including Sonic, John Wick, Star Wars, the Marvel Cinematic Universe, and the DCEU. He has also gathered an audience online through collaborating with prominent online creators, including David Dobrik and Pokimane. He is the brother of makeup artist Kate Moneta, whose work has been featured in the fashion industry through collaborations with luxury brands including Gucci and Prada; as well as more recent collaborations within the film industry.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:56:10+00:00","tmdbId":6379957,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/6379957","credits":[{"id":"marvels","title":"The Marvels","character":"Agent Heath","characterFa":"مامور هیث"},{"id":"thunderbolts","title":"Thunderbolts*","character":"CIA Agent","characterFa":"مامور سیا"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/jimmy-moneta.webp","filmography":[{"name":"72 HOURS","year":2026,"character":"Cyclist","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9Bu1PW2R1XayqRqnl0aDOgMcrdS.jpg"},{"name":"Mike & Nick & Nick & Alice","year":2026,"character":"Finn","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7F0jc75HrSkLVcvOXR2FXAIwuEv.jpg"},{"name":"A Working Man","year":2025,"character":"Office Intern (uncredited)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6FRFIogh3zFnVWn7Z6zcYnIbRcX.jpg"},{"name":"Thunderbolts*","year":2025,"character":"CIA Agent","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hqcexYHbiTBfDIdDWxrxPtVndBX.jpg","characterFa":"مامور سیا"},{"name":"The Garfield Movie","year":2024,"character":"Milkman (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/p6AbOJvMQhBmffd0PIv0u8ghWeY.jpg"},{"name":"The Fall Guy","year":2024,"character":"Photographer (uncredited)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/e7olqFmzcIX5c23kX4zSmLPJi8c.jpg"},{"name":"Sonic the Hedgehog 3","year":2024,"character":"Rogue Soldier","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/d8Ryb8AunYAuycVKDp5HpdWPKgC.jpg"},{"name":"No Hard Feelings","year":2023,"character":"Teen Boy","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gD72DhJ7NbfxvtxGiAzLaa0xaoj.jpg"},{"name":"John Wick: Chapter 4","year":2023,"character":"Paris Driver (uncredited)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vZloFAK7NmvMGKE7VkF5UHaz0I.jpg"},{"name":"The Marvels","year":2023,"character":"Agent Heath","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9GBhzXMFjgcZ3FdR9w3bUMMTps5.jpg","characterFa":"مامور هیث"},{"name":"Minions: The Rise of Gru","year":2022,"character":"Additional Voices (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4dBDk1LPdvdhcZdjQBmdXwiVKUA.jpg"},{"name":"Sonic the Hedgehog 2","year":2022,"character":"Military Soldier (uncredited)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6DrHO1jr3qVrViUO6s6kFiAGM7.jpg"},{"name":"Ms. Marvel","year":2022,"character":"Agent Heath","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3HWWh92kZbD7odwJX7nKmXNZsYo.jpg","characterFa":"مامور هیث"},{"name":"The Boss Baby: Family Business","year":2021,"character":"Additional Voices (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aQ7huOn3F0iJCJrFezS8p9WEsri.jpg"},{"name":"Sonic the Hedgehog","year":2020,"character":"Military Soldier (uncredited)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aQvJ5WPzZgYVDrxLX4R6cLJCEaQ.jpg"},{"name":"Scary Stories to Tell in the Dark","year":2019,"character":"Drive-in Employee (uncredited)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uy0dNFbhRhHBLwpOGpcTw9UEwdX.jpg"},{"name":"Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker","year":2019,"character":"Stormtrooper (uncredited)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/db32LaOibwEliAmSL2jjDF6oDdj.jpg"}],"nameFa":"جیمی مونتا","bioFa":"جیمی مونتا (زاده ۲۰ ژوئیه ۲۰۰۰) یک هنرپیشه لهستانی-آمریکایی است. از زمان شروع حرفه بازیگری خود در سال 2019، او در انواع تولیدات سینمایی و تلویزیونی ظاهر شده است و به خاطر نقش های کوچکترش در فرنچایزهای عظیم از جمله Sonic، John Wick، Star Wars، Marvel Cinematic Universe و DCEU شناخته شده است. او همچنین از طریق همکاری با سازندگان برجسته آنلاین، از جمله دیوید دوبریک و پوکیمن، مخاطبان آنلاین را جمع آوری کرده است. او برادر آرایشگر کیت مونتا است که کارهایش در صنعت مد از طریق همکاری با برندهای لوکس از جمله گوچی و پرادا به نمایش درآمده است. و همچنین همکاری های اخیر در صنعت فیلم.","birthPlaceFa":"بیکرزفیلد، کالیفرنیا، ایالات متحده آمریکا"}}
